.TH JVMUMPS 7 "2026-10-08" "JvMumps/mJVM" "Miscellanea"
.SH NAME
jvmumps \- JvMumps (Java M) and mJVM (JVM-native M) overview
.SH DESCRIPTION
The JvMumps / mJVM tree is a full-M implementation family with
RSM-equivalent scope. RSM is the model and conformance oracle; layout and
SLOC may differ.
.TP
.B JvMumps
Full M in Java: interpreter + StoreApi (memory / SQLite), smoke waves
J0–W310, shared conformance corpus.
.TP
.B mJVM
M as a JVM language: M IR, IrMachine, ClassEmitter (.class), invokedynamic
CALL/GOTO, devices / JOB / LOCK / transactions, rsm-shaped CLI
.BR mjvm (1).
.SH PACKAGE LAYOUT
.TP
.I src/main/java/jvmumps/
JvMumps engine (LineInterp, ExprEval, PatternMatch, StoreApi).
.TP
.I src/main/java/mjvm/
mJVM compiler, IR, runtime, CLI, bench.
.TP
.I bin/mjvm
Launcher.
.TP
.I install.sh
Install to
.B PREFIX
(default
.IR ~/.local ).
.TP
.I man/
Manual pages:
.BR mjvm (1)
and this page.
.TP
.I docs/mjvm-perf.md
M8 performance targets and measured results.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mjvm (1),
.I CRITICAL_PATH.md
in the source tree.
